@HostAddress = http://localhost:5294

### 1. Test GET Exams List
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/exams
Accept: application/json

### 2. Test Candidate Login
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student",
  "password": "Student@123"
}

### 3. Test Teacher Login
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "teacher",
  "password": "Teacher@123"
}

### 4. Validation test (rỗng -> 400)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "password": ""
}

### 5. Start a session (dán token từ bước 2 vào @CandidateToken)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/examsessions/start
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{CandidateToken}}

{
  "userId": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333",
  "examId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa"
}

### 6. Autosave draft
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/examsessions/autosave
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{CandidateToken}}

{
  "sessionId": "{{SessionId}}",
  "skillType": 3,
  "draftContent": "Ban nhap bai Writing..."
}

### 7. Restore draft
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/examsessions/{{SessionId}}/draft?skillType=3
Authorization: Bearer {{CandidateToken}}

### 8. Session result
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/examsessions/{{SessionId}}/result
Authorization: Bearer {{CandidateToken}}

### 9. Pending reviews (teacher/admin only)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/grading/pending-reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{TeacherToken}}

### 10. Sessions list for proctoring (teacher/admin only)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/proctoring/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{TeacherToken}}
